# Incidents

Blameless incident log and postmortem records.
Format adheres to [make-a-change](https://github.com/alexsmedile/make-a-change).

## YYYY-MM-DD: Incident Title <!-- ref: inc-001 -->
- **Severity**: Low | Medium | High | Critical
- **Impact**: User-facing or system impact summary.
- **Root Cause**: Underlying trigger and contributing factors.
- **Remediation**:
  - [ ] Actionable fix to prevent recurrence <!-- ref: todo-001 -->
